		{"id":"grp-shared","type":"group","x":2550,"y":0,"width":5400,"height":1190,"label":"04.10 SHARED AI PLATFORMS (enterprise capabilities, not domain apps)","color":"#d81b60"},
		{"id":"grp-gtas","type":"group","x":2550,"y":1390,"width":5400,"height":970,"label":"03 GTAS INTERNAL APPLICATIONS - Legacy Internal Development","color":"#5c6bc0"},
		{"id":"grp-3p","type":"group","x":2550,"y":2560,"width":5400,"height":1600,"label":"02 THIRD-PARTY ENTERPRISE APPLICATIONS","color":"#a0522d"},
		{"id":"grp-wfx","type":"group","x":2550,"y":4360,"width":5400,"height":1810,"label":"01 WFX ERP CORE - Core Enterprise Transaction System","color":"6"},
		{"id":"grp-data","type":"group","x":2550,"y":6370,"width":5400,"height":670,"label":"05 DATA / KNOWLEDGE FOUNDATION","color":"#26a69a"},
		{"id":"grp-poc","type":"group","x":-4600,"y":2560,"width":3200,"height":3030,"label":"06 POC / VENDOR EVALUATION (evaluation only)"},
		{"id":"grp-legend","type":"group","x":-4600,"y":5790,"width":3200,"height":3490,"label":"09 LEGEND"},
		{"id":"grp-collab","type":"group","x":10800,"y":0,"width":1650,"height":850,"label":"07 EXTERNAL COLLABORATION"},
		{"id":"grp-arch","type":"group","x":10800,"y":1050,"width":1650,"height":2550,"label":"08 ARCHIVED / CLOSED ENABLEMENT"},
		{"id":"grp-gap","type":"group","x":10800,"y":5750,"width":3200,"height":2930,"label":"DATA / GOVERNANCE GAP (curated notes, written 24/09/2026)"},
		{"id":"eco-title","type":"text","x":0,"y":-1700,"width":10500,"height":260,"text":"# PPJ GROUP - Digital Application, AI & Automation Ecosystem\n## ERP -> Enterprise Applications -> Internal Systems -> AI & Automation"},
		{"id":"eco-subtitle","type":"text","x":0,"y":-1420,"width":10500,"height":200,"text":"### Portfolio Baseline: 19/09/2026  |  Vault Reconciliation: 24/09/2026 (portfolio snapshot)\nGenerated From: PPJ AI & Automation Portfolio (vault registry) + PPJ operating-systems landscape ([[02_BA_Knowledge/Enterprise_Architecture/PPJ_Operational_Systems_Landscape|Operational Systems Landscape]]). Regenerated automatically when the portfolio snapshot changes."},
		{"id":"eco-exec-summary","type":"text","x":0,"y":-1180,"width":3300,"height":900,"text":"# PPJ DIGITAL EVOLUTION\n\n### 1. WFX provides the ERP transaction backbone.\n### 2. Third-party enterprise applications provide specialized capabilities.\n### 3. GTAS applications were built internally to fill operational capability gaps.\n### 4. AI & Automation selectively augment specific modules and business flows.\n### 5. Shared data, knowledge and AI platforms serve reusable cross-functional capabilities.\n### 6. AI does not replace the ERP; it augments ERP, enterprise systems and decisions."},
		{"id":"eco-principles","type":"text","x":3600,"y":-1180,"width":3300,"height":900,"text":"# ARCHITECTURE PRINCIPLES\n\n### - WFX remains core ERP / transaction backbone.\n### - AI projects augment rather than duplicate source systems.\n### - System of record must remain explicit.\n### - Prefer API-based integration where available.\n### - Business affinity does not imply technical integration.\n### - Human review remains required for uncertain AI decisions.\n### - Reusable data / knowledge layers serve multiple projects.\n### - Shared AI services reduce duplicate implementations.\n### - Status and lifecycle are independent from business domain."},
		{"id":"eco-inventory","type":"text","x":7200,"y":-1180,"width":3300,"height":900,"text":"# PORTFOLIO INVENTORY\n\n## Baseline 19/09/2026 - 35 initiatives\n### Active / Dev 16 | Production 6 | Maintenance 4 | Closed 4 | On Hold 3 | Evaluation 2\n\n## Current Vault 24/09/2026 - 36 registered records\n### Production 8 | Active / Dev 9 | UAT / Eval / Analysis 5 | Maintenance 4 | On Hold 3 | Closed 7\n\nBaseline is kept unchanged. Bucket definitions differ - see the gap notes."},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-mer","type":"text","x":30,"y":20,"width":1132,"height":170,"text":"# 04.2 MERCHANDISING"},
		{"id":"proj-mer-marketintelligence-v1-1-0","type":"text","x":100,"y":210,"width":1450,"height":700,"text":"# Market Intelligence\n## [[03_Projects/E-commerce Market Intelligence v.2.3|MER_MarketIntelligence_v1.1.0]]\n### Active Intelligence\n\n**AI APPLICATION - data intelligence**\nProduct, customer and material opportunities from DWH, order history, Style Library and external market signals. An intelligence layer, not a WFX transaction app.\nBaseline: MER.MARKET.INTELLIGENCE.v1.1","color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-mer-pocommit-v1-1-0","type":"text","x":100,"y":970,"width":1450,"height":640,"text":"# PO Commit Automation\n## [[03_Projects/MER.PO-Commit|MER_POCommit_v1.1.0]]\n### Closed\n\n**AUTOMATION**\nCustomer order to order processing to PO, ready for production; covered about 70-80% of customer scenarios. Historical record.\nBaseline: MER.PO.Commit.v1.1","color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"proj-mer-invoicedatarecheck-v1-1-0","type":"text","x":100,"y":1670,"width":1450,"height":700,"text":"# Invoice Data Recheck\n## [[03_Projects/MER.CHICOS.INVOICE.RECHECK-AUDIT.v1.1|MER_InvoiceDataRecheck_v1.1.0]]\n### Production / Support\n\n**AUTOMATION - audit / rule engine**\nCross-checks costing, commercial and invoice data against configurable per-customer rules, across multiple customers; exceptions go to human review.\nBaseline: MER.INVOICE.DATA.RECHECK.v1.1","color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-mer-costingagenticplatform-v1-1-0","type":"text","x":100,"y":2430,"width":1450,"height":700,"text":"# Agentic Costing Platform\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1|MER_CostingAgenticPlatform_v1.1.0]]\n### Active Development\n\n**AI APPLICATION - agents / decision support**\nSimilar-style retrieval, technical data and consumption to a costing recommendation. Sew Agent and Wash Agent are parts of this platform; a domain expert confirms.\nBaseline: COSTING.AGENTIC.PLATFORM.v1.1","color":"5"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-fab","type":"text","x":30,"y":3410,"width":1420,"height":170,"text":"# 04.7 FABRIC / TECHNICAL"},
		{"id":"proj-td-technicalknowledgeplatform-v2-1-0","type":"text","x":100,"y":3600,"width":1450,"height":640,"text":"# Technical Knowledge Platform\n## [[03_Projects/TD.TechnicalPlatform_v2.1|TD_TechnicalKnowledgePlatform_v2.1.0]]\n### Sync Validation & Stabilization\n\n**DATA PLATFORM - knowledge foundation**\nTechnical knowledge from Style Library, BOM, GTAS IED and Consumption; the foundation of the Agentic Costing Platform. Not an ERP system of record.\nBaseline: TD.TechnicalKnowledge.Platform.v2.1","color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-fab-fabricdatamart-v2-2-0","type":"text","x":100,"y":4300,"width":1450,"height":580,"text":"# Fabric Datamart\n## [[03_Projects/FD.Datamart.v2.2|FAB_FabricDatamart_v2.2.0]]\n### Support\n\n**DATA PLATFORM - datamart**\nFabric, hanger, QR and material reference data (Directus). Separate from CPD.\nBaseline: FD.Datamart.v2.2","color":"#6f8fa8"},
		{"id":"proj-cpd-visualsampledatamart-v1-1-0","type":"text","x":100,"y":4940,"width":1450,"height":580,"text":"# Visual Sample Datamart\n## [[03_Projects/CPD.Datamart.v1.1|CPD_VisualSampleDatamart_v1.1.0]]\n### Maintenance\n\n**DATA PLATFORM - datamart**\n3D / visual sample library and image search. Separate from FD.\nBaseline: CPD.Datamart.v1.1","color":"#6f8fa8"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-src","type":"text","x":30,"y":5800,"width":1590,"height":170,"text":"# 04.1 SOURCING / PURCHASING"},
		{"id":"proj-scp-sourcingchatbot-v2-3-0","type":"text","x":100,"y":5990,"width":1450,"height":640,"text":"# Sourcing AI Chatbot\n## [[03_Projects/SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3|SCP_SourcingChatbot_v2.3.0]]\n### Production\n\n**AI APPLICATION - RAG / chatbot**\nSupplier, material and sample search, comparison and sourcing knowledge from WFX Inventory Control and Raw Material Planning.\nBaseline: SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3","color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-pur-inventoryreport-v2-1-0","type":"text","x":100,"y":6690,"width":1450,"height":640,"text":"# Purchasing Inventory Report\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Inventory Report|PUR_InventoryReport_v2.1.0]]\n### Production\n\n**DATA PLATFORM - reporting / visibility**\nMaterial, stock and availability visibility from WFX Inventory Control and MMSx. Reporting, not an automation bot.\nBaseline: PUR.Inventory.Report.v2.1","color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-pur-materialallocation-v1-1-0","type":"text","x":100,"y":7390,"width":1450,"height":720,"text":"# Material Allocation Automation\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.2|PUR_MaterialAllocation_v1.1.0]]\n### Validation / Stabilization\n\n**AUTOMATION - workflow / transaction**\nSurplus material: unreserve, find an eligible OC, reallocate, validate. First Sewing / Embroidery flow validated.\nBaseline: PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.1","color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-pur-adhocindentsouth-v1-0-0","type":"text","x":100,"y":8170,"width":1450,"height":660,"text":"# Adhoc Indent Automation (South)\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Adhoc Indent mien Nam|PUR_AdhocIndentSouth_v1.0.0]]\n### Maintenance\n\n**AUTOMATION - rule-based**\nRule-based processing of repeated Adhoc Indents for the South region into WFX purchasing.\nBaseline: PUR.Adhoc.Indent.South.v1.0","color":"#6f8fa8"},
		{"id":"proj-pur-gdiautomation-v1-0-0","type":"text","x":100,"y":8890,"width":1450,"height":640,"text":"# GDI Automation\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.GDI Automation|PUR_GDIAutomation_v1.0.0]]\n### Active Development / WFX API Integration\n\n**AUTOMATION - API-first transaction**\nGoods dispatch / goods issue posted to WFX Logistics Out-bound through the WFX API; API development and integration preparation.\nBaseline: PUR.GDI.Automation.v1.0","color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-pur-hmlabelprocessing-v1-0-0","type":"text","x":100,"y":9590,"width":1450,"height":580,"text":"# H&M Label-O Processing\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.H&M Label-O Processing|PUR_HMLabelProcessing_v1.0.0]]\n### On Hold\n\n**AUTOMATION - rule-based**\nH&M Label-O processing; paused pending a scalable business case.\nBaseline: PUR.HM.LabelO.Processing.Automation.v1.0","color":"2"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-hr","type":"text","x":8880,"y":20,"width":499,"height":170,"text":"# 04.8 HR"},
		{"id":"proj-hr-employeedataplatform-v1-1-0","type":"text","x":8950,"y":210,"width":1450,"height":640,"text":"# HR Employee Data Platform\n## [[03_Projects/HR.SS&PFD.v1.1|HR_EmployeeDataPlatform_v1.1.0]]\n### Production / Expansion\n\n**WORKFLOW - data standardization**\nEmployee data collection, validation and standardization into an Employee Master on HRIS; applicant extraction / prefill.\nBaseline: HR.SSPFD.Workflow.v1.1","color":"4"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-admin","type":"text","x":8880,"y":1130,"width":1190,"height":170,"text":"# 04.9 ADMINISTRATION"},
		{"id":"proj-admin-expensemanagement-v1-1-0","type":"text","x":8950,"y":1320,"width":1450,"height":840,"text":"# Business Travel & Expense Management\n## [[03_Projects/ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0|ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0]]\n### Active / Requirement Refinement / UAT Preparation\n\n**WORKFLOW**\nPPJ internal Admin application outside WFX: request, approval, advance, expense, settlement. E-office link blocked: service stopped, reopening fee under re-quote.\nBaseline: Admin Expense Management.v1.1","color":"3"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-fin","type":"text","x":8880,"y":2440,"width":1536,"height":170,"text":"# 04.3 FINANCE / ACCOUNTING"},
		{"id":"proj-fin-financemanagement-v1-2-0","type":"text","x":8950,"y":2630,"width":1450,"height":820,"text":"# Finance AI Management\n## [[03_Projects/FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1|FIN_FinanceManagement_v1.2.0]]\n### Strategic Active\n\n**AI APPLICATION - finance analytics / control**\nWS1 financial reporting foundation | WS2 OC cost, profitability and variance control | WS3 factory cost integrity: salary, overhead, performance.\nBOD drill-down: Group > Company > Division > Sales Group > OC. Analytics and control, not a financial system of record.\nBaseline: FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.2","color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-acc-grnsupplierinvoicebot-v2-3-0","type":"text","x":8950,"y":3510,"width":1450,"height":580,"text":"# GRN Supplier Invoice Bot\n## [[03_Projects/ACC.GRN-SupplierInvoiceBot.v2.3|ACC_GRNSupplierInvoiceBot_v2.3.0]]\n### Production Support\n\n**AUTOMATION - transaction bot**\nPO, GRN, supplier invoice, validation and matching, then accounting entry.\nBaseline: ACC.GRNInvoiceMatching.v2.3","color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-fin-invoicedownloader-v1-2-0","type":"text","x":8950,"y":4150,"width":1450,"height":640,"text":"# Invoice Downloader\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.Invoice Downloader.v1.2|FIN_InvoiceDownloader_v1.2.0]]\n### Production\n\n**AUTOMATION**\nDownloads source invoice files from VNPT E-Invoice; session handling updated for VNPT's new protection layer. No accounting posting.\nBaseline: PPJ.InvoiceDownloader.v1.2","color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-acc-inventoryreport-v1-0-0","type":"text","x":8950,"y":4850,"width":1450,"height":580,"text":"# Accounting Inventory Report\n## [[03_Projects/ACC.Inventory.Report.v1.0|ACC_InventoryReport_v1.0.0]]\n### Closed\n\n**DATA PLATFORM - reporting**\nAccounting inventory reporting. Distinct from the Purchasing Inventory Report.\nBaseline: ACC.Inventory.Report.v1.0","color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"proj-exim-expenseinvoices-automation-v1-1","type":"text","x":8950,"y":5490,"width":1450,"height":660,"text":"# EXIM Expense Invoice Bot (legacy)\n## [[03_Projects/EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1|EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1]]\n### Closed\n\n**AUTOMATION**\nLegacy EXIM expense-invoice automation, replaced by Expense Invoice Processing (LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing).","color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-qc","type":"text","x":8880,"y":6430,"width":844,"height":170,"text":"# 04.5 QC / TQM"},
		{"id":"proj-qc-defectdetection-v1-0-0","type":"text","x":8950,"y":6620,"width":1450,"height":640,"text":"# AI Defect Detection\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxQSee.ai|QC_DefectDetection_v1.0.0]]\n### On Hold\n\n**AI APPLICATION - computer vision (vendor)**\nDefect detection and classification with QC review. Vendor proposal and NDA only; not an approved PoC.\nBaseline: PPJxQSee.AI","color":"2"},
		{"id":"proj-qc-threadtraceability-v1-0-0","type":"text","x":8950,"y":7320,"width":1450,"height":580,"text":"# RFID Thread Traceability\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread|QC_ThreadTraceability_v1.0.0]]\n### Pre-PoC / Business Case\n\n**POC / EVALUATION**\nRFID thread identification and traceability. Business case only; no PoC approved.\nBaseline: QC.Primo1D.RFID.Thread.v1.0","color":"3"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-prod","type":"text","x":8880,"y":8180,"width":1363,"height":170,"text":"# 04.4 PRODUCTION + WASH"},
		{"id":"proj-prod-hanginglineiot-v1-0-0","type":"text","x":8950,"y":8370,"width":1450,"height":640,"text":"# Hanging Line IoT\n## [[03_Projects/PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1|PROD_HangingLineIoT_v1.0.0]]\n### Development\n\n**IOT**\nHanging-line digitization and production visibility, read through WFX Reporting & Analysis; a future data source for Smart Factory analytics.\nBaseline: PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo.v1.0","color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-wash-samplingmanagement-v1-1-0","type":"text","x":8950,"y":9070,"width":1450,"height":660,"text":"# Wash Sampling Management Portal\n## [[03_Projects/WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1|WASH_SamplingManagement_v1.1.0]]\n### Analysis / Product Design\n\n**WORKFLOW**\nWash sample request, planning, result and approval in the PPJ Group Portal.\nBaseline: WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1","color":"3"},
		{"id":"proj-wash-cowash-v2-0-0","type":"text","x":8950,"y":9790,"width":1450,"height":580,"text":"# COWASH Wash Operations\n## [[03_Projects/PROD.COWASH|WASH_COWASH_v2.0.0]]\n### On Hold\n\n**SYSTEM - wash production (vendor)**\nWash production workflow and operational data. Distinct from the sampling portal.\nBaseline: PROD.COWASH.v2.0","color":"2"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-whl","type":"text","x":8880,"y":10650,"width":1590,"height":170,"text":"# 04.6 WAREHOUSE / LOGISTICS"},
		{"id":"proj-wh-awbextraction-v1-1-0","type":"text","x":8950,"y":10840,"width":1450,"height":640,"text":"# AWB Document Intelligence\n## [[03_Projects/WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0|WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0]]\n### Active Development\n\n**AI APPLICATION - document intelligence**\nAWB image OCR and DHL shipment email in one project: parse, normalize, match by AWB number, validate, human review.\nBaseline: WH.AWB.EXTRACTION.v1.1","color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-log-expenseinvoiceprocessing-v1-2-2","type":"text","x":8950,"y":11540,"width":1450,"height":760,"text":"# Expense Invoice Processing\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ. Expense-Invoices.v1.1|LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.2]]\n### Regional Rollout / UAT\n\n**AUTOMATION - expense invoices**\nOne application used by several units: shared expense invoices and Logistics / EXIM. Regional tax templates and charge rules; UAT / rollout in HCM, Da Nang, Nha Trang, Ha Noi.\nBaseline: PPJ.ExpenseInvoices.v1.1 + LOG.EXPENSE.INVOICES.V1.2 (one application)","color":"3"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-shared","type":"text","x":2580,"y":20,"width":1536,"height":170,"text":"# 04.10 SHARED AI PLATFORMS"},
		{"id":"proj-ai-perriplatform-v3-2-0","type":"text","x":2925,"y":210,"width":1450,"height":660,"text":"# PERRI Enterprise Chatbot\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.PERRI.Chatbot|AI_PERRIPlatform_v3.2.0]]\n### Production\n\n**INTERNAL PLATFORM - shared AI channel**\nEnterprise Q&A and orchestration channel shared by every domain; not attached to any single WFX module.\nBaseline: PPJ.PERRI.Chatbot.v3.2","color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-ai-applicationhub-v2-1-0","type":"text","x":4525,"y":210,"width":1450,"height":660,"text":"# PPJ AI Hub\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1|AI_ApplicationHub_v2.1.0]]\n### Internal Production Platform\n\n**INTERNAL PLATFORM - AI access / governance**\nAI application access, orchestration and governance foundation; not attached to any single WFX module.\nBaseline: PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1","color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-ppj-glpi-helpdesk-ai-chatbot-v1-0","type":"text","x":6125,"y":210,"width":1450,"height":660,"text":"# GLPI AI Helpdesk (Merchandising)\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.GLPI-Helpdesk-AI Chatbot|PPJ.GLPI.Helpdesk.AI.Chatbot.v1.0]]\n### Maintenance\n\n**AI APPLICATION - helpdesk / knowledge assistant**\nAI helpdesk for merchandisers: enterprise systems, WFX usage, merchandising process, SOP, troubleshooting and previously resolved issues.","color":"#6f8fa8"},
		{"id":"shared-note","type":"text","x":2925,"y":930,"width":4650,"height":220,"text":"### Enterprise capabilities, not business-domain applications.\nPERRI and AI Hub are shared channels: they are deliberately not attached to individual WFX modules. Lines are drawn only where documentation confirms use."},
