		{"id":"wfx-finance","type":"text","x":6500,"y":4570,"width":1350,"height":160,"text":"# ● Finance","color":"6"},
		{"id":"wfx-production-planning","type":"text","x":6500,"y":4770,"width":1350,"height":160,"text":"# Production Planning","color":"6"},
		{"id":"wfx-qc","type":"text","x":6500,"y":4970,"width":1350,"height":160,"text":"# QC","color":"6"},
		{"id":"wfx-qa","type":"text","x":6500,"y":5170,"width":1350,"height":160,"text":"# QA","color":"6"},
		{"id":"wfx-production-management","type":"text","x":6500,"y":5370,"width":1350,"height":160,"text":"# Production Management","color":"6"},
		{"id":"wfx-logistics-in-bound","type":"text","x":6500,"y":5570,"width":1350,"height":160,"text":"# ● Logistics In-bound","color":"6"},
		{"id":"wfx-logistics-out-bound","type":"text","x":6500,"y":5770,"width":1350,"height":160,"text":"# ◐ Logistics Out-bound","color":"6"},
		{"id":"wfx-sampling","type":"text","x":6500,"y":5970,"width":1350,"height":160,"text":"# ◐ Sampling","color":"6"},
		{"id":"wfx-core","type":"text","x":4100,"y":4570,"width":2300,"height":1560,"text":"# WFX ERP\n### Core Enterprise Transaction System\n\n## ◐ Reporting & Analysis\n### Time & Action Tracking\n### Textiles / Garments\n\n16 modules, named from the owner's operating-systems diagram. WFX is the system of record for orders, purchasing, material, inventory and operational transactions. AI and automation augment WFX; they do not replace it.","color":"6"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-data","type":"text","x":2580,"y":6390,"width":1824,"height":170,"text":"# 05 DATA / KNOWLEDGE FOUNDATION"},
		{"id":"data-technical-knowledge","type":"text","x":2670,"y":6810,"width":1550,"height":190,"text":"## Technical Knowledge\nRealised by the Technical Knowledge Platform (04.7)","color":"#26a69a"},
		{"id":"data-doc-retrieval","type":"text","x":4485,"y":6580,"width":1550,"height":190,"text":"## Document / Knowledge Retrieval\nConceptual foundation layer","color":"#26a69a"},
		{"id":"data-dwh","type":"text","x":6300,"y":6580,"width":1550,"height":190,"text":"## Enterprise Data / DWH\nDWH / Databricks - confirmed in the 2026-09-18 ecosystem note","color":"#26a69a"},
		{"id":"data-master","type":"text","x":2670,"y":6580,"width":1550,"height":190,"text":"## Master Data\nConceptual foundation layer","color":"#26a69a"},
		{"id":"data-workflow","type":"text","x":4485,"y":6810,"width":1550,"height":190,"text":"## Workflow & Process Data\nConceptual foundation layer","color":"#26a69a"},
		{"id":"data-reporting","type":"text","x":6300,"y":6810,"width":1550,"height":190,"text":"## Reporting & Analytics\nPower BI - confirmed in the Finance AI project documents","color":"#26a69a"},
		{"id":"flow-labels","type":"text","x":2550,"y":7240,"width":5400,"height":1250,"text":"# CAPABILITY STORIES\n## SYSTEM > DATA > AUTOMATION > AI / ANALYTICS > CONTROL > DECISION > BUSINESS OUTCOME\n\n### COMMERCIAL & MARKET INTELLIGENCE: Market Intelligence\n### ORDER PROCESSING: PO Commit (historical) > future Customer Order Processing\n### COSTING & TECHNICAL INTELLIGENCE: Technical Knowledge Platform > Agentic Costing > Pattern Generation PoC\n### SOURCING INTELLIGENCE: Sourcing AI Chatbot\n### MATERIAL & PURCHASING EXECUTION: Inventory Report > Material Allocation > Adhoc Indent > GDI\n### PRODUCTION INTELLIGENCE: Hanging Line IoT > future Smart Factory\n### FINANCE & BUSINESS CONTROL: Finance AI > GRN Invoice Matching > Expense Invoice Processing\n### ENTERPRISE SUPPORT / WORKFLOW: GLPI AI Helpdesk, Business Travel & Expense, AWB, PERRI"},
		{"id":"source-systems-diagram","type":"file","x":-4600,"y":-1700,"width":3200,"height":1785,"file":"99_Attachments/PPJ_Operational_Systems_Landscape_Diagram.png"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-poc","type":"text","x":-4570,"y":2580,"width":1593,"height":170,"text":"# 06 POC / VENDOR EVALUATION"},
		{"id":"poc-discovery-patterngenerationpoc","type":"text","x":-4500,"y":2770,"width":1450,"height":720,"text":"# PatternGenerationPoC\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|DISCOVERY_PatternGenerationPoC]]\n### DAF / Commercial / Technical Scope Negotiation\n\n**VENDOR EVALUATION - discovery item, not a project**\nScope: Pattern generation PoC. Do not reuse the historical PPJxStratova.AI code.\nAlso: PPJxStratova.AI - the closed Stratova record (zone 08). No production integration.","color":"3"},
		{"id":"poc-cand-cpd-in-house-pattern-generation","type":"text","x":-2950,"y":2770,"width":1450,"height":720,"text":"# CPD In-house Pattern Generation\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/Project_Update_Proposals/CPD_IN_HOUSE_PATTERN_GENERATION_CURRENT_INITIATIVE|CPD In-house Pattern Generation]]\n### Internal Prototype / Evaluation\n\n**CANDIDATE - not a registered project**\nBuild an internal pattern-generation benchmark from techpack/image/measurement inputs with Pattern Engineer and CAD validation.\nCanonical code not confirmed.","color":"3"},
		{"id":"proj-ppjxnunox-scantrial","type":"text","x":-4500,"y":3550,"width":1450,"height":640,"text":"# NUNOX Scan Trial\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxNUNOX|PPJxNUNOX.ScanTrial]]\n### Partnership / Digital Library Evaluation\n\n**POC / EVALUATION**\nFabric scanning and fabric / garment digital library evaluation; outcome unconfirmed.","color":"3"},
		{"id":"poc-wizcore","type":"text","x":-2950,"y":3550,"width":1450,"height":640,"text":"# Wizcore\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|Wizcore]]\n### Smart Factory Discovery\n\n**VENDOR EVALUATION - discovery item, not a project**\nScope: Factory -> IoT -> Connectivity -> Integration -> Data -> Dashboard -> Traceability -> Analytics / AI.\nNo operational integration assumed.","color":"3"},
		{"id":"poc-faceworks-ai","type":"text","x":-4500,"y":4250,"width":1450,"height":700,"text":"# Faceworks AI\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|Faceworks AI]]\n### Technology Assessment\n\n**VENDOR EVALUATION - discovery item, not a project**\nScope: Potential garment/textile AI capabilities under evaluation.\nNo operational integration assumed.","color":"3"},
		{"id":"poc-sortech","type":"text","x":-2950,"y":4250,"width":1450,"height":700,"text":"# Sortech\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|Sortech]]\n### Technology / SI Assessment\n\n**VENDOR EVALUATION - discovery item, not a project**\nScope: Potentially relevant to invoice automation, GRN workflows, WFX automation, reconciliation, approvals, agentic workflows and smart-factory integration.\nNo operational integration assumed.","color":"3"},
		{"id":"poc-quanskill","type":"text","x":-4500,"y":5010,"width":1450,"height":520,"text":"# Quanskill\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|Quanskill]]\n### Vendor / Product Evaluation\n\n**VENDOR EVALUATION - discovery item, not a project**\nScope: Not yet an approved implementation project.\nNo operational integration assumed.","color":"3"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-legend","type":"text","x":-4570,"y":5810,"width":614,"height":170,"text":"# 09 LEGEND"},
		{"id":"legend-coverage","type":"text","x":-4500,"y":6000,"width":3000,"height":780,"text":"# MODULE COVERAGE BADGE\n### ● live AI / automation coverage (production / support) - green\n### ◐ in development / UAT / planned - blue\n### ○ evaluation, on hold or historical only - grey\n### no badge - no project touches this module yet\n\nBadge = the most advanced project touching the module. By BOD decision (24/09) QC, Production Planning and Production Management carry no badge yet; their lines still show on hover."},
		{"id":"legend-nodes","type":"text","x":-4500,"y":6820,"width":3000,"height":780,"text":"# NODE CATEGORIES\n### WFX ERP - purple\n### Third-Party System - brown\n### GTAS Internal System - indigo\n### Data / Knowledge Platform - teal\n### Shared AI Platform - pink group\n### Project card colour = STATUS (below)\n\nThe type is on each card under the status: AI APPLICATION | AUTOMATION | WORKFLOW | DATA PLATFORM | INTERNAL PLATFORM | IOT | POC / EVALUATION | COLLABORATION | ARCHIVED"},
		{"id":"legend-edges","type":"text","x":-4500,"y":7640,"width":3000,"height":780,"text":"# LINES (shown on hover / click)\n### INTEGRATION - confirmed system integration (green, solid)\n### PLANNED - planned or in development (orange, dashed)\n### DATA - data dependency / source (blue, dashed)\n### KNOWLEDGE - knowledge / RAG / reference (cyan, dotted)\n### AFFINITY - business relationship, no integration (grey, dotted)\n\nThe label always names the type, and PRIMARY marks a project's main module. Lines of closed projects are grey."},
		{"id":"legend-status","type":"text","x":-4500,"y":8460,"width":3000,"height":780,"text":"# STATUS COLOUR\n### Green - Production / Operational\n### Blue - Active / Development\n### Yellow - UAT / Evaluation / Analysis\n### Orange - On Hold\n### Grey-blue - Maintenance / Support\n### Grey - Closed / Archived\n\nThe exact source status is written on each card under the project code."},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-collab","type":"text","x":10830,"y":20,"width":1536,"height":170,"text":"# 07 EXTERNAL COLLABORATION"},
		{"id":"proj-ext-academiccollaboration-v1-1-0","type":"text","x":10900,"y":210,"width":1450,"height":580,"text":"# Academic Collaboration (UIT)\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1|EXT_AcademicCollaboration_v1.1.0]]\n### Active / Problem Framing\n\n**COLLABORATION**\nPrototypes, research, competitions and talent pipeline with UIT. Not a production application.\nBaseline: PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1","color":"5"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-arch","type":"text","x":10830,"y":1070,"width":1248,"height":170,"text":"# 08 ARCHIVED / CLOSED"},
		{"id":"proj-ppjxstratova-ai","type":"text","x":10900,"y":1260,"width":1450,"height":660,"text":"# Stratova AI (historical record)\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxStratova AI|PPJxStratova.AI]]\n### Closed\n\n**ARCHIVED - former AI PoC**\nClosed record. The active pattern-generation PoC continues as Pattern Generation PoC (zone 06): one active PoC, not two.","color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"proj-ai-automation-workshop-202606","type":"text","x":10900,"y":1980,"width":1450,"height":540,"text":"# AI Automation Workshop (June 2026)\n## [[03_Projects/AI Automation Workshop|AI.Automation.Workshop.202606]]\n### Closed\n\n**ARCHIVED - enablement**\nWorkshop record. No active tasks.","color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"proj-ai-automation-workshop-analysis-202606","type":"text","x":10900,"y":2580,"width":1450,"height":450,"text":"# Workshop Analysis (June 2026)\n## [[03_Projects/Workshop Analysis|AI.Automation.Workshop.Analysis.202606]]\n### Closed\n\n**ARCHIVED - enablement**\nWorkshop analysis record. No active tasks.","color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"proj-vitas-sharing-202606","type":"text","x":10900,"y":3090,"width":1450,"height":450,"text":"# VITAS Sharing (June 2026)\n## [[03_Projects/VITAS Sharing|VITAS.Sharing.202606]]\n### Closed\n\n**ARCHIVED - external engagement**\nExternal sharing record. No active tasks.","color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"guide","type":"text","x":10800,"y":3800,"width":3200,"height":1750,"text":"# HOW TO READ THIS CANVAS\n\n### Zoomed out - coverage: a badge on a WFX / GTAS module means AI / automation already touches it.\n### Hover or click - detail: the exact modules, systems and projects, with the line type.\n### Centre, top to bottom: shared AI platforms, GTAS, third-party, WFX ERP core, data / knowledge foundation. Left and right: AI & Automation projects by business domain.\n\n## INTERACTION\n### - Hover an AI / Automation project: show its connected enterprise modules\n### - Hover a WFX / GTAS module: show the AI / Automation projects related to it\n### - Click: pin the focus    - Esc or click the background: reset\n### - Command 'PPJ Canvas Focus: Toggle presentation / editing mode'\n\nA line exists only where a vault document or the BOD connection matrix supports it; no line means no relationship is documented. Interaction needs the PPJ Canvas Focus plugin (enabled in this vault)."},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-gap","type":"text","x":10830,"y":5770,"width":1363,"height":170,"text":"# DATA / GOVERNANCE GAPS"},
		{"id":"gap-1","type":"text","x":10900,"y":5960,"width":3000,"height":640,"text":"## GAP 1 - Expense invoices\n\nThe 35-item baseline lists PPJ.ExpenseInvoices.v1.1 and LOG.EXPENSE.INVOICES.V1.2 as two projects. The vault registry maps both to ONE project, LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.2, and the BOD review recording (24/09, T 03:09-04:39) describes one application extended to several units.\n\nDrawn as one card carrying both baseline names; primary line to WFX Finance.\n\nVault also holds two closed records outside the baseline: EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1 and AI.Automation.Workshop.Analysis.202606."},
		{"id":"gap-2","type":"text","x":10900,"y":6640,"width":3000,"height":640,"text":"## GAP 2 - Canonical codes and status\n\nACC.GRNInvoiceMatching.v2.3 (baseline) vs ACC_GRNSupplierInvoiceBot_v2.3.0 (vault canonical); canonical used.\n\nStratova: one active PoC representation - Pattern Generation PoC (zone 06, discovery register). The closed PPJxStratova.AI record is kept in zone 08 for traceability.\n\nGLPI chatbot: described as the merchandising AI helpdesk per the owner's update; not heard in the part of the 24/09 recording received. Vault domain stays Internal Chatbot & AI Platforms."},
		{"id":"gap-3","type":"text","x":10900,"y":7320,"width":3000,"height":640,"text":"## GAP 3 - Systems inventory\n\nSource: owner's operating-systems diagram. GTAS has 16 applications, not 15: GTAS Costing was missing from the list in circulation.\n\nMMSx (diagram) vs MMX (2026-09-18 ecosystem note): treated as one system, name unconfirmed.\n\nThe diagram stars GTAS Costing and highlights Production Planning without stating why. BOD 24/09 suggested dropping GTAS Compliance from the BOD view (unused); it is still shown."},
		{"id":"gap-4","type":"text","x":10900,"y":8000,"width":3000,"height":640,"text":"## GAP 4 - Relationship evidence\n\nINTEGRATION only where validated: Material Allocation to WFX Inventory Control, Invoice Downloader to VNPT. PLANNED: GDI via WFX API, Costing via the GTAS/IED contract, Admin to E-office (blocked by the reopening fee). Everything else is DATA, KNOWLEDGE or AFFINITY.\n\nRecording over analysis (24/09): Sourcing chatbot reads Inventory Control, not MMSx; the IoT hanger reads through Reporting & Analysis; no badge on QC / Production modules; no line to GTAS Transportation. QSee to WFX QC dropped (vendor evaluation, not in the matrix)."}
	],
